          <h2 style={{fontFamily: 'var(--font-display)', fontWeight: '700', letterSpacing: '-0.03em', lineHeight: '1.2', fontSize: '23px', margin: '6px 0 0', color: 'var(--ink)'}}>Everything, always in <span className="opit">view.</span></h2>
